"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A mapping closure. "},{"code":"transform","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" accepts an element"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of this sequence as its parameter and returns a transformed value of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same or of a different type."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"transform"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An asynchronous sequence that contains, in order, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"non-"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" elements produced by the "},{"code":"transform","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" closure."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"code":"compactMap(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method to transform every element received from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a base asynchronous sequence, while also discarding any "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" results"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the closure. Typically, you use this to transform from one type of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"element to another."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In this example, an asynchronous sequence called "},{"code":"Counter","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" produces "},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values from "},{"code":"1","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"code":"5","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The closure provided to the "},{"code":"compactMap(_:)","type":"codeVoic